  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2042326d26ec7b593e52bbbdd22d890b59b1e59f92be81a7235509e9af1c4625.png] \n\nGiven equation : 24 - 36 × 5 + 108 ÷ 18 = 18 \n\nNow, by interchanging the signs\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : ÷ and -\n\n24 - 36 × 5 + 108 ÷ 18 = 18 ⇒ **24 ÷ 36**__ × 5 + 108 - 18 = 18 \n\n__**0.67 **____**× 5**__ + 108 - 18 = 18\n\n__**3.35 + 108**__ - 18 = 18\n\n__**111.35 - 18**__ = 18\n\n93.85 ≠ 18 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : - and +​\n\n24 - 36 × 5 + 108 ÷ 18 = 18 ⇒ 24 + 36 × 5 - **108 ÷ 18**__ = 18\n\n24 + __**36 × 5**__ - 6 = 18\n\n__**24 + 180**__ - 6 = 18\n\n__**204 - 6**__ = 18\n\n198 ≠ 18 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : + and × \n\n24 - 36 × 5 + 108 ÷ 18 = 18 ⇒ 24 - 36 + 5 × **108 ÷ 18**__ = 18\n\n24 - 36 + __**5 **____**×**____** 6**__ = 18\n\n__**24 + 30**__ - 36 = 18\n\n__**54 - 36**__ = 18\n\n**18 = 18 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : + and ÷\n\n24 - 36 × 5 + 108 ÷ 18 = 18 ⇒ 24 - 36 × **5 ÷ 108**__ + 18 = 18\n\n24 - __**36 × 0.04**__ + 18 = 18\n\n__**24 + 18**__ - 1.44 = 18\n\n__**42 - 1.44**__ = 18\n\n40.56 ≠ 18 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (3)\" is the correct answer.",
